OL,3,GNEWSABattery warning backed by family
OL,4,Adevastated by fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA family who lost "everything" in a
OL,7,Fhouse fire are supporting a battery
OL,8,Fsafety campaign so others do not have
OL,9,Fto suffer their trauma.
OL,11,FThe fire tore through the home of Chris
OL,12,FPearson, 51, and his daughter Kaitlin,
OL,13,F26, two years ago, destroying two
OL,14,Fdecades of memories.
OL,16,F"I'm constantly turning everything
OL,17,Felectric off in my house before I go to
OL,18,Fbed and double, triple-checking before
OL,19,FI go to sleep," Kaitlin said. "It's an
OL,20,Fanxiety I'll never shake off."
